      "outcome": "success",
      "exception": null,
      "narration": "Niles Vanner regards the tall, overweight stranger with the mild early balding and white hairs, his expression politely guarded. He does not know this man, has not heard of him, and has no basis to guess at origins or station.\n\n\"Sir, I don't know you,\" he says, his tone level and professionally neutral. \"Never had the acquaintance, and I couldn't say where you're from. You look new to this part of Calderan, if I had to guess from the question itself. Is there something you're looking to sell, or—\" He leaves the invitation open, his hands still, the empty balance pan on its counter untouched for now.",
